<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-David Jones Q3 sales down 3.2 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-David Jones Q3 sales down 3.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Upmarket retailer David Jones Ltd said on Tuesday its sales for the 13 weeks to April 26 fell 3.2 percent to A$290.5 million.</p>
<p>David Jones said retail conditions remained difficult but it remained cautiously optimistic that a general retail upturn would occur in the first half of fiscal 1997/98.</p>
</text>
